cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FAPM, please cite it as below."
title: "Feature-Annotated Process Models (FAPM): a specification method for clinical AI workflows"
abstract: >-
  FAPM attaches a data specification to each step of a clinical AI workflow: the features each step
  requires, can see, reads, and produces. Static analysis of the annotation surfaces missing producers,
  branch-dependent inputs, undeclared data flows, provenance gaps and unstructured override data before
  deployment. Includes a specification, a worked ambient AI documentation example, and a checker.
type: software
